  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have worked alongside Jedi or other Force-users and have developed an excellent rapport.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, when you are targeted or affected by a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Talent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Talent\">Force Talent</a> originating from an ally, you gain one temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>, which must be spent before the end of the encounter or it goes away. If the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Talent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Talent\">Force Talent</a> damages you or moves you down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>, you do not gain the benefit of this Feat.</p>",
